# Redirect Rules for Kindo Animalerie

# HTTP to HTTPS
http://kindopet.com/* https://kindopet.com/:splat
http://www.kindopet.com/* https://kindopet.com/:splat

# WWW to non-WWW
https://www.kindopet.com/* https://kindopet.com/:splat

# Language Redirects
/en / 302
/eng / 302

# Old Product URLs to New Structure
/produits/* /products/:splat 301
/products/cat-food /products/nourriture-chats 301
/products/dog-food /products/nourriture-chiens 301

# Category Redirects
/chiens /categories/chiens 301
/chats /categories/chats 301
/oiseaux /categories/oiseaux 301

# Campaign Redirects
/promo/* /promotions/:splat 301
/soldes/* /promotions/:splat 301

# Trailing Slash Normalization
/:splat/ /:splat 301

# 404 Handler
/* /404.html 404
